erties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walksthrough\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Walks Through</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Energy Field (Square)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"19\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Field_Square_8987b7.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Energy<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Fire\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_0ff2ec.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Fire<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poison Gas\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poison_Gas_c58dd6.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Poison</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">12.70.10953<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 12, 2021<br/>Summer Update 2021</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20210615195653&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Abominable_Spawn_e98781.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an abominable spawn.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Abomination\">The Abomination</a> is a raid boss that spawns approximately every 180 days. When this raid happens, it starts with the <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Abominable Spawn</strong> appearing in 4 out of 10 possible locations. The miniboss on the 4 locations share the same health pool and it seems to be required to have players in all rooms to defeat it. The remaining portals will bring you to empty rooms. The possible locations are:\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>Hellgate</b>: go down the hole <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32703,31594,13\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32703, 31594, 13)</a> and down two more levels to find the portal <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32701,31612,15\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32701, 31612, 15)</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Dark Cathedral</b>: go to the undead creatures are east of the entrance, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32711,32368,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32711, 32368, 8)</a>, then go south to find the portal <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32740,32435,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32740, 32435, 9)</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Krailos</b>: inside the Wailing Widow's <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33686,31745,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">cave (33686, 31745, 7)</a> on the second floor <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33665,31783,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33665, 31783, 9)</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Zao Steppe</b>: inside the Lancer Beetle's <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33221,31398,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">cave (33221, 31398, 7)</a> on the second floor, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33216,31406,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33216, 31406, 10)</a>. (You need part of <a href=\"#/quest/a-fathers-burden-quest\">A Father's Burden Quest</a> to enter here).</li>\n<li><b>Gnomebase Alpha</b>: go down the ramp to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Mushroom%20Gardens\">Mushroom Gardens</a> near the portal to the Warzones, then down again and the portal will be to the west, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32902,31907,11\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32902, 31907, 11)</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Ankrahmun</b>: Enter the Larvae cave <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33153,32687,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33153, 32687, 7)</a> and go down to the lowest floor with Scarabs, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33099,32688,11\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33099, 32688, 11)</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Beregar</b>: from the Wagon room at the mines, go down, through the south door and down again, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32609,31514,15\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32609, 31514, 15)</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Edron Cyclopolis</b>: All they towards the main Behemoths area, then to the south corridor and up the ramp, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33301,31755,14\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33301, 31755, 14)</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Svargrond Formorgar Mines</b>: Take the elevator to the third floor of the mines, then go down the stairs next to it and go south-east, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32247,31164,12\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32247, 31164, 12)</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Kazordoon Dwarf Mines</b>: Enter the mine between the river streams, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32540,31942,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32540, 31942, 7)</a>, and go down several floors until you reach the teleport <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32510,31943,13\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32510, 31943, 13)</a>.</li></ul>\n<p>Once the <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Abominable Spawn</strong> is defeated, its corpse will become a vortex that brings players to the lair of The Abomination. Only through the 4 original portals where the Spawn was present it will be possible to reach The Abomination.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Melee</span> (0-1000? and <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> starting up to 25 hp/turn)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility abilityWithScene\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Drain\"><img alt=\"Life Drain\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Drain_Icon_bda9d3.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Life Drain Strike</span> (600-900)<div class=\"abilityScene\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"scene_table dirt_floor\" style=\"padding:32px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"tibiatext caster_name\">Abominable Spawn</div><div class=\"hp_bar\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"caster-south\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20210615195653&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Abominable_Spawn_e98781.gif\"/></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect no_effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"missile_area\" data-horiz=\"200\" data-vert=\"200\" style=\"width:200%;height:200%;\">\n<div data-anim-dir=\"south-east\" style=\"position:relative;padding:0;width: 32px;height: 32px;z-index:2;animation:south-east 1s infinite !important;\">\n<div class=\"sprite\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=201