ation</span></h3>\n<p>It appears when <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Abomination\">The Abomination</a> raids the world and it will be present in 4 out of 10 possible locations, listed above.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tAn abominable spawn attacks in melee range.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tThe Spawn has a large health pool and a very strong self-healing, so you need a lot of firepower to kill it fast. The more damage players deal to it, the lower the chance of it using its healing spells and recovering a lot of health. It's possible to kill it with only a few shooters but you'll need to be lucky so it doesn't heal very often and it will still take a long time.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><i>There is no loot data for this creature. Please consider subtmitting loot logs for this creature using the Loot Statistics parser.</i>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Bio-Elementals\">Bio-Elementals</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Abyssador\">Abyssador</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Aggressive%20Matter\">Aggressive Matter</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Alptramun\">Alptramun</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Angry%20Plant\">Angry Plant</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bane%20Bringer\">Bane Bringer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bane%20Lord\">Bane Lord</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Beast\">Blood Beast</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bloom%20of%20Doom\">Bloom of Doom</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bog%20Raider\">Bog Raider</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Branchy%20Craw